  "guide_lib.entry.economy.admin_json": "JSON Configuration",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.overview.p1": "Earn money from everyday Minecraft\nactivities, then spend it at NPC shops,\ninvest in ETF shares, and trade\nwith other players.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.overview.p2": "[Basic loop]\n① Mine, harvest, fish, and fight for rewards\n② Deposit spare cash at an ATM\n③ Buy and sell at shops, invest in ETF\n④ Trade on the flea market",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.money.basics": "Money is split between cash\n(on hand) and bank savings.\nShops and the flea market\nusually pay from cash.\nYour balance appears in UIs and chat.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.money.rewards": "[How to earn]\n· Mine ores\n· Harvest crops, pumpkins, melons\n· Fish (rarer fish pay more)\n· Kill mobs (split by damage dealt)\nChat shows \"Earned ¥…\" when\nyou get a reward.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.money.penalty": "[Watch out]\nDying costs part of your cash.\nMoney in the bank is safe.\nDeposit at an ATM before\ncarrying large amounts.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.atm.spotlight": "Right-click an ATM in the world\nto open deposit and withdraw screens.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.atm.usage": "Enter an amount, then:\nDeposit — cash to bank\nWithdraw — bank to cash\nUse ±$100 / ±$10 / ±$1,\nALL buttons, or hold to adjust quickly.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.shop_npc.spotlight": "Right-click villager-style NPCs\nto open a shop screen.\nEach location may buy, sell,\ntrade stocks, or run a flea market.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.shop_npc.types": "[NPC roles]\n· Shop — buy items\n· Pawn shop — sell your items\n· Exchange — ETF trading screen\n· Flea market — player listings\nThey look like villagers;\ninteract to see what each one does.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.shop_npc.trade": "Pick an item from the list,\nthen Buy/Sell 1 or 16.\nBalance, inventory count, and\npurchase limits are shown.\nButtons gray out if you\ncannot afford the trade.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.stock_trade.spotlight": "Right-click the Mobile Terminal\nor talk to an exchange NPC\nto trade ETF shares\nfrom anywhere.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.stock_trade.tabs": "[Tabs]\n· Market info — price charts\n· Normal trade — buy / sell shares\n· Short selling — short / cover\nPick a stock, set quantity,\nthen execute.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.stock_trade.tips": "[Tips]\nETF prices move when players\ntrade related items at shops.\nBuy low, sell high.\nShort selling lets you profit\nwhen you expect a price drop.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.flea_market.overview": "Talk to a flea market NPC\nto buy and sell with other players.\nList rare items or spare materials\nat your own price.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.flea_market.list": "On New Listing, pick an item,\nset unit price and quantity.\nListed items leave your inventory\nuntil sold or cancelled.\nUse My Listings to cancel.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.flea_market.buy": "On Market, browse other players'\nlistings. Check seller, price,\nand remaining quantity.\nBuy with cash; items go\nto your inventory.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.loan.spotlight": "Right-click the pillager-style\nloan NPC to borrow or repay.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.loan.borrow": "Enter an amount and borrow.\nCash is added to your hand,\nbut +10% interest (rounded)\nis added to your debt.\nThe repay preview shows\nthe total before you confirm.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.loan.repay": "Repay from cash on hand.\nRepay ALL fills the smaller of\ndebt and cash.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.admin_setup.p1": "[Starting Economy]\n1. Install the mod on your world/server\n2. On first world load,\n   config/economy/economy_master.json\n   is created automatically\n3. Get NPC spawn eggs from the\n   admin block Spawner tab\n4. When players join,\n   balance data is created in the world",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.admin_setup.p2": "Works in singleplayer, LAN,\nand dedicated servers.\nNo Node.js server required.\n\nThe master JSON is exported\non first world load.\nGUI saves also write to\nthe same file.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.admin_block.spotlight": "The Economy Admin Block is\na 3×2 bulletin board.\nRight-click to open the admin GUI.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.admin_block.place": "[Placement]\nNeeds a clear 3 wide × 2 tall area.\nPlace on the bottom-center block;\nthe other five blocks fill in.\n\n[Permissions]\nView balances — everyone\nEdit master / reset — solo host or OP",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.admin_gui.tabs": "[Main tabs]\n· Balance — view player cash,\n  bank, and debt\n· Master — balance, rewards,\n  prices, shop assignment, ETF\n· Spawner — NPC spawn eggs\n· Admin — data reset,\n  ranking compile",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.admin_gui.master": "[Master tab edits]\n· Balance — death penalty,\n  short-sell limit, ETF interval,\n  loan limits\n· Rewards — reward amounts\n· Prices — buy/sell for\n  existing items\n· Shop assignment — NPC shop,\n  daily/personal limits\n· ETF — influence weights\n\nSave writes to\nconfig/economy/economy_master.json",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.admin_gui.manage": "[Admin tab]\nReset balances, rankings,\nETF, shop limits, flea market,\netc. individually.\n\nReset to bundled overwrites\n the master JSON with the\nmod default (file is kept).",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.admin_json.file": "[Config file]\nconfig/economy/economy_master.json\n\n· Auto-exported on first\n  world load\n· GUI saves update the\n  same file\n· Restart the world after\n  manual edits to apply",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.admin_json.sections": "[Edit in JSON]\n· items — add items,\n  itemKey (other mods OK),\n  names, buy/sell prices\n· shopItems — new shop\n  listings, order\n· shops — shop names,\n  NPC types\n· etfItems — new ETF links\n· actionRewards — new\n  reward types\n\nThe GUI only changes\nvalues on existing rows.",
  "guide_lib.economy.page.admin_json.tips": "[Tips]\n· itemKey format:\n  modid:item_id\n  (e.g. minecraft:iron_ingot)\n· shopItems itemId must\n  match items.id\n· Invalid JSON breaks loading\n\nAfter a mod update, diff your\nconfig against the bundled\nJSON and merge new entries.",
